  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A lot of desktop users often notice how I use my hands to interact with the menu they can't see, and this makes things quite awkward. Perhaps, making the whole menu visible isn't exactly the point here, but at least I'd like to see when other users open their menu. \n\nAnd I definitely would prefer it being an optional thing, since some people, including me, use specific avatars that aren't supposed to move, so, just in case, we open the menu to not look away accidentally or something, and UI might cover the whole avatar. But other than that, I don't have any other reasons not to assume that we need this feature.",
